  "details": "The title is self explanatory. Sometimes when I invite friends into private lobbies they sometimes think it would be funny if they vote kicked me. This would be fine if it didn’t temp ban me from that world for an hour. I think this needs to be fixed to where the option to vote kick the owner is not avalible. If you have this issue than please say something in the comments and vote.",
